{
    "background_story": "Baboo was a majestic peacock known for his extravagant plumage and flair for titivation. Every morning, he would spend hours preening his vibrant feathers, making sure every barb and quill was perfectly aligned. His favorite pastime was strutting around the forest, showcasing his dazzling display of colors to any bird who would watch. Baboo's love for titivation went beyond his own appearance; he would often help his fellow birds with their grooming, making sure they looked their absolute best. His attention to detail and passion for beauty earned him the title of 'Royal Groomer' among the forest's avian community. During mating season, Baboo's stunning appearance and impeccable style made him the most sought-after suitor, and his courtship displays were the talk of the forest.",
